      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Greywind\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/48/2006_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Greywind:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Sounds like a reason to stop using Apple.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have an ipad because there are games and other apps that I love that I can't get on Android.</p>\n<p>Even if I had the spare money to buy an Android device (clue: I really don't) it would be a huge waste to rebuy so many apps. And I'd need to rebuy SotM and the season pass. I'd lose my Sentinels \"history\", and we know that stats are being collected for future use.</p>\n<p>So no. I'll continue to use Apple.</p>",
